{"op":"add","path":"/elements/save","value":{"type":"Button","props":{"label":"Save changes","variant":"primary"},"children":[],"on":{"press":{"action":"profile.update","params":{"displayName":{"$state":"/displayName"},"bio":{"$state":"/bio"}}}}}}
